<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 257)</h2>
<p><b>Web Review takes shape</b> — the encrypted media pipeline is in.</p>
<ul>
<li>Groundwork continues for the browser client seat: a shared review can now package its current clip as an <b>encrypted review proxy</b> — rendered through the same export pipeline, split into one-second segments, sealed so the cloud only ever stores noise, and playable frame-accurately in a browser.</li>
<li>All internal plumbing this build; the client-facing share sheet and join links arrive with the next phases.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
